'''Mass Production EVA Strikes!''' (エヴァ量産機強襲, ''EVA Ryōsan-ki Kyōshū'', '''Mass Production EVA Assault''') is a [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Neon Genesis Evangelion]] collaboration stage added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], it features the [[Mass Production EVA (Enemy)|Mass Production EVA]] enemy.

==Overview==
===About===
Mass Production EVA Strikes! contains a total of eight [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Annihilation Lvs''' and one called '''This is the End!'''. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Annihilation Lv. can include [[Catfruit]] and [[Catseye]]s. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

